{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pale Incense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gothic adventure about love, immortality, and sacrifice.<br>Play as Edmund, a vampire perfumer who hunts by night to save the dying soul of his beloved wife.<br>Craft perfumes from human essences, manage your shop by day, and survive the deadly streets by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>By Day: The Perfume Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/4432a882cfc1bc7778cb4f148f72ef9b.avif?t=1770376226\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your laboratory, craft various fragrance types from human essences and from these fragrances, create unique perfumes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers, sell perfumes, and earn money to grow your shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/09bb6266eefbc4fe19cced1589355a86.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/09bb6266eefbc4fe19cced1589355a86.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/09bb6266eefbc4fe19cced1589355a86.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment, unlock new recipes, and expand your storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to customize your vampire lair below the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daytime is not endless. Once time runs out, no more customers will come, and the streets will call you back to the hunt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/05cf3ae7defce42a5e85fa34c11b44fb.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/05cf3ae7defce42a5e85fa34c11b44fb.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/05cf3ae7defce42a5e85fa34c11b44fb.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Vampire Lair</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/31ae8798984361b41b6399a0d04ce15b.avif?t=1770376226\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath your shop lies your hidden refuge, a sanctuary for you and your dying wife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the magical human stones you gather to craft healing incense and keep Johanna alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to burn this incense each day, Johanna will be one step closer to death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/c919cff762e119bfb09cbe751199b125.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/c919cff762e119bfb09cbe751199b125.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/c919cff762e119bfb09cbe751199b125.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your vampire bed to reduce nightly hunger and health loss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert vampire stones into Vampire Reputation to unlock new vampire skills so you can assign them to your ability slots.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/eb01b9c852fbc377843ed3a1d14efa1f.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/eb01b9c852fbc377843ed3a1d14efa1f.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/eb01b9c852fbc377843ed3a1d14efa1f.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>By Night: The District</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/43dde93dc55210ac974db064a0ff2afa.avif?t=1770376226\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a gothic city filled with danger and prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt and feed on humans to survive, if your hunger drops too low, your health will begin to drain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/13434457ac1f4cdf06e7c8ba53629a8f.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/13434457ac1f4cdf06e7c8ba53629a8f.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/13434457ac1f4cdf06e7c8ba53629a8f.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden chests containing rare vampire stones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine vampire stones with the human essences collected from your victims\u2019 corpses to create magical human stones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide corpses to avoid alerting the townsfolk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/3b66b5f3d8d923cefaf109f928ce4884.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/3b66b5f3d8d923cefaf109f928ce4884.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/3b66b5f3d8d923cefaf109f928ce4884.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is essential. If too many people witness your horrific acts, the district will enter lockdown, and the streets will empty for a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless enemies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scrooge Brothers, vampire hunters who track you anywhere except the \u201cBack Alley.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious rooftop archer, striking without warning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feral werewolf lurking in the \u201cBack Alley,\u201d far stronger than you, flee on sight.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night is not endless. Before dawn, reach the boat waiting by the river or the first light of day will burn you, and death will be inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/08450b5c4d89a4d26eda683dd6e21374.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/08450b5c4d89a4d26eda683dd6e21374.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/08450b5c4d89a4d26eda683dd6e21374.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep alchemy and perfume crafting system, featuring 30 types of scents and 20 unique perfumes to create</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual gameplay: shop management by day, survival and hunting by night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of vampire abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic vampire love story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive district system with panic, alerts, and lockdown phases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lair customization and upgrade mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense encounters with hunters, the archer, and werewolf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark gothic atmosphere </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083990?t=1770376226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/f73606e64d0afcea00f6889f981af99d1012794d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770376226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/5a11f2cd4d16772771c5e966a92a5446fd0a10cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770376226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/5a11f2cd4d16772771c5e966a92a5446fd0a10cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770376226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4286100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pale Incense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gothic adventure about love, immortality, and sacrifice.<br>Play as Edmund, a vampire perfumer who hunts by night to save the dying soul of his beloved wife.<br>Craft perfumes from human essences, manage your shop by day, and survive the deadly streets by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>By Day: The Perfume Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/4432a882cfc1bc7778cb4f148f72ef9b.avif?t=1770376226\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your laboratory, craft various fragrance types from human essences and from these fragrances, create unique perfumes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers, sell perfumes, and earn money to grow your shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/09bb6266eefbc4fe19cced1589355a86.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/09bb6266eefbc4fe19cced1589355a86.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/09bb6266eefbc4fe19cced1589355a86.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment, unlock new recipes, and expand your storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to customize your vampire lair below the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daytime is not endless. Once time runs out, no more customers will come, and the streets will call you back to the hunt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/05cf3ae7defce42a5e85fa34c11b44fb.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/05cf3ae7defce42a5e85fa34c11b44fb.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so