=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/eb01b9c852fbc377843ed3a1d14efa1f.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/eb01b9c852fbc377843ed3a1d14efa1f.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/eb01b9c852fbc377843ed3a1d14efa1f.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>By Night: The District</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/43dde93dc55210ac974db064a0ff2afa.avif?t=1770376226\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a gothic city filled with danger and prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt and feed on humans to survive, if your hunger drops too low, your health will begin to drain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/13434457ac1f4cdf06e7c8ba53629a8f.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/13434457ac1f4cdf06e7c8ba53629a8f.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/13434457ac1f4cdf06e7c8ba53629a8f.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden chests containing rare vampire stones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine vampire stones with the human essences collected from your victims\u2019 corpses to create magical human stones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide corpses to avoid alerting the townsfolk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/3b66b5f3d8d923cefaf109f928ce4884.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/3b66b5f3d8d923cefaf109f928ce4884.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/3b66b5f3d8d923cefaf109f928ce4884.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is essential. If too many people witness your horrific acts, the district will enter lockdown, and the streets will empty for a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless enemies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scrooge Brothers, vampire hunters who track you anywhere except the \u201cBack Alley.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious rooftop archer, striking without warning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feral werewolf lurking in the \u201cBack Alley,\u201d far stronger than you, flee on sight.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night is not endless. Before dawn, reach the boat waiting by the river or the first light of day will burn you, and death will be inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/08450b5c4d89a4d26eda683dd6e21374.poster.avif?t=1770376226\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/08450b5c4d89a4d26eda683dd6e21374.webm?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/extras/08450b5c4d89a4d26eda683dd6e21374.mp4?t=1770376226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep alchemy and perfume crafting system, featuring 30 types of scents and 20 unique perfumes to create</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual gameplay: shop management by day, survival and hunting by night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of vampire abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic vampire love story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive district system with panic, alerts, and lockdown phases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lair customization and upgrade mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense encounters with hunters, the archer, and werewolf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark gothic atmosphere </p></li></ul>","developers":["Ongun Ayhan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083990/059229df2de4657c7ffb9fc7a251c1c25bf965ff/header.jpg?t=1770376226","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements"